Sval: build Sval's component directory

browser/components/sval holds every file Sval adds. Listing it in DIRS is the
one change to Mozilla's build files it needs.

diff --git a/browser/components/moz.build b/browser/components/moz.build
index d1d769ab09..c38c273885 100644
--- a/browser/components/moz.build
+++ b/browser/components/moz.build
@@ -68,6 +68,7 @@ DIRS += [
     "sessionstore",
     "shell",
     "sidebar",
+    "sval",
     "syncedtabs",
     "tabbrowser",
     "tabnotes",
